---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<title>Straum</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Straum is a durable event log for one server. Version 0 is experimental." />
		<style>
			:root { color-scheme: light dark; --fg: #1a1a1a; --muted: #5c5c5c; --bg: #ffffff; }
			@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { :root { --fg: #ececec; --muted: #a0a0a0; --bg: #141414; } }
			body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); font: 17px/1.6 system-ui, sans-serif; }
			main { max-width: 34rem; padding: 2rem 1rem; }
			h1 { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 2rem; }
			p { margin: 0.75rem 0; color: var(--muted); }
			a { color: inherit; }
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<h1>Straum</h1>
			<p>A durable event log for one server. Version 0 is experimental: one node, loopback only, formats not stable. Not for production.</p>
			<p><a href="/start/getting-started/">Getting started</a> · <a href="/reference/protocol/">Protocol</a> · <a href="/reference/guarantees/">Guarantees</a></p>
			<p>The previous code and documentation are kept on GitHub under the tag <code>archive/main-2026-10-23</code> in each <a href="https://github.com/straum-io">straum-io</a> repository.</p>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
